<title>USA: El Al removes cargo surcharges.</title>
<headline>El Al removes cargo surcharges.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Al Israel Airlines announced it will remove the 10 cents per kilo cargo fuel surcharge it has had in place since November 15, 1996, with effect from today (Tuesday).</p>
<p>The carrier applied its surcharge on all flights with European destinations. &quot;Tel Aviv was never affected,&quot; said Bob Riddell, cargo sales manager.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 fax +5017</p>
